# Replace one lane's desired stocking policy under a caller-captured lane revision.
# The revision fence makes the change all-or-nothing: a stale expected_lane_revision is refused
# without changing the lane or the persisted policy document, and a persistence failure applies
# nothing. A policy change bumps the lane revision and invalidates that lane's depletion evidence
# until the next accepted LaneObservation. An in-flight reservation keeps the policy it was
# granted under; a reservation not yet granted fails on the existing revision-conflict path.

string lane_id
uint64 expected_lane_revision
uint8 expected_product_class
bool has_expected_sku
string expected_sku
uint32 target_count
---
restocker_interfaces/WorldStateOperationStatus status
uint64 world_revision
